LibreELEC RK3588 / Rock 5T Dolby Vision CHANGELOG
=================================================

## 2026-11-23

### Dolby Vision Profile 7 Dual-Track & Stability
- Reworked dual-track Profile 7 (Blu-ray ISO/M2TS) playback into two independent decoders (BL + EL via `DemuxPacket::elData/elSize/elPts`, Kodi patches `0023`–`0025`).
- Take Dolby Vision RPU metadata from the enhancement layer frame when present (`0026`), and log refused RPU details in `pi-dv-engine` (`0004`).
- Allow repeated non-decreasing pivots (e.g. `0,0,1023` on Transformers 2 UHD Blu-ray) in `pi-dv-engine` planner and reference composer (`0005`).
- Changed `DemuxPacket::elPts` to `double` (`0027`) and added `PAIR_TOLERANCE_US` (2 ms) to `pi-dv-engine` pairer (`0006`) to eliminate rounding-induced unpaired frame drops.
- Added dual-track DV Profile 7 demuxer pairing (`0014`, including Blu-ray TS PID `0x1011`/`0x1015` pairing without PMT `HDMV` descriptor) and Annex-B EL support (`0015`).
- Allowed `ext_mapping_idc` in RPU (`pi-dv-engine 0003`), preserved dirty GUI frames (`0009`), and cleared DV state on init (`0013`).

### HDMI Audio Passthrough
- Enabled HDMI audio passthrough UI (`appliance.xml` `<visible>true</visible>`, default `ALSA:hdmi:CARD=hdmi0,DEV=0`) and ALSA `hdmi0`/`hdmi1` mappings (`simple-card.conf`).
- Updated `AESinkALSA` (`0021`) to detect `sysdefault:CARD=hdmiX` via ELD, open `hw:` for passthrough with `IEC958 Playback Default`, and restore PCM status afterwards.
- Added `dw-hdmi-qp` kernel patch (`rockchip-0193`) to enable 8-channel `AUD_HBR` mode over I2S when `IEC958_AES0_NONAUDIO` is active (TrueHD / DTS-HD MA).

### HDR Vivid, Subtitles & Cloud Blu-ray
- Added real-time HDR Vivid to Dolby Vision Profile 8.1 conversion in `DVDDemuxFFmpeg` and `DVDVideoCodecDRMPRIME` (`0020`).
- Added local Chinese PGS subtitle OCR identification and fast stream switch without seeking (`0019`, CPU `onnxruntime 1.23.2` + `ppocrv5-mobile-rec-int8.onnx`).
- Added cloud Blu-ray direct play and UDF/ISO block caching optimizations (`0018`).
- Added Chinese subtitle language preferences/priority (`0016`) and dynamic subtitle vertical offset (`0017`).

## 2026-11-22

- Enabled Standard (TV-led) Dolby Vision support in Kodi 22 Piers for RK3588 (`0001`–`0012`, `DOLBY_VISION_SUPPORT="yes"`).
- Attached DRM `Broadcast RGB` connector property defaulting to Full range (`rockchip-0192`).
- Fixed `pi-dv-engine` `dvbench` DRM hwdevice fallback, Rockchip connector props, and `v4l2request` preference for RK3588.

## 2026-11-21

- Added Linux 6.19 DRM HDMI `"Dolby Vision"` property, Dolby VSIF attachment, and VOP2 YUV background fixes (`rockchip-0188`–`0191`).
- Integrated `pi-dv-engine` (`0.5.0`) with linear `NV15` input support (`0001-add-nv15-linear-support.patch`).

## 2026-11-20

- Initial LibreELEC 13 (Rockchip RK3588 / Radxa Rock 5T) baseline with Linux 6.19.0, Mesa PanVK Vulkan, and GitHub Actions build workflow (`.github/workflows/build-rock5t.yml`).

